10
01:12:46,666 --> 01:12:52,666
Moonfall is a 2022 science fiction disaster film co-written,
directed, and produced by Roland Emmerich.

11
01:20:03,333 --> 01:20:09,333
It stars Halle Berry, Patrick Wilson, John Bradley, Michael Peña, Charlie
Plummer, Kelly Yu, Carolina Bartczak, and Donald Sutherland.

12
01:27:20,000 --> 01:27:26,000
It follows two former astronauts alongside a conspiracy theorist who discover the
hidden truth about the Moon when it suddenly leaves its orbit.

13
01:34:36,666 --> 01:34:42,666
Shot in Montreal on a $138–146 million budget, it is one of the most
expensive independently produced films ever made.

14
01:41:53,333 --> 01:41:59,333
The film was theatrically released in North America and the UK on February 4,
2022, by Lionsgate and Entertainment Film Distributors respectively.

15
01:49:10,000 --> 01:49:16,000
It received mixed reviews from critics and was a box office failure,
grossing $67 million worldwide on the budget of $150 million.

16
01:56:26,666 --> 01:56:32,666
The film explores themes of moon, looting, space
travel, flooding, lost civilisation.

17
02:03:43,333 --> 02:03:49,333
The tone is thought_provoking.
